d schedule) is completed.\nAnd you can bet its replacement won't serve us nearly as long as this one and its departed twin did."},{"author":"100330886@N04","date":"2016-01-08 12:26:07","text":"It's tough.  A lot of things these days are built better than they were before and yet are less interesting.  You get to like something the way it is.  Every time I see this bridge I notice another interesting thing about it.  It is complicated and decrepit and beautiful.  The new one certainly won't be as compelling to look at."},{"author":"94223476@N08","date":"2016-01-09 07:23:33","text":"unusual perspective"},{"author":"130542955@N02","date":"2016-01-11 07:09:37","text":"Great POV."}],"description":"","detail":"photos/0079.json","filename":"24217766355_19c4e26e56_o.jpg","flickr_url":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/24217766355/","height":3000,"id":"24217766355","kind":"photo","license":"All Rights Reserved","original":"originals/24217766355/24217766355_19c4e26e56_o.jpg","sha256":"012491b1f257360885dfc1f9c443789a45c35a1c37c0d51b6aa3d2e2ac412f56","tags":[],"taken":"2015-11-27 17:12:34","title":"IMG_7147","uploaded":"2016-01-06 13:54:43","width":3999},"24230735356":{"albums":[{"id":"72157643911711523","position":4883},{"id":"72157676335372788","position":42}],"bytes":4681311,"camera_position":4883,"comments":[],"description":"","detail":"photos/0079.json","filename":"24230735356_b86c40dea7_o.jpg","flickr_url":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/24230735356/","height":3000,"id":"24230735356","kind":"photo","license":"All Rights Reserved","original":"originals/24230735356/24230735356_b86c40dea7_o.jpg","sha256":"ee77a3b9a713e50cc0b83491acbfc3232aa015df23b0cec295d5570042ab91d1","tags":[],"taken":"2015-11-28 10:27:39","title":"IMG_7168","uploaded":"2016-01-08 12:26:00","width":4000},"24230739089":{"albums":[{"id":"72157643911711523","position":4997}],"bytes":2708448,"camera_position":4997,"comments":[{"author":"127431856@N05","date":"2016-01-24 23:26:06","te